truct WideExact {\n    c0: QM31,\n    c1: QM31,\n}","attr_info":{"attributes":[{"DocComment":" `E = QM31[v]/(v² - u)`, where `u² = 2+i` and `i² = -1`."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Exactly two QM31 coordinates, `c0 + c1*v`, or eight canonical M31 limbs."},{"DocComment":" For digits `d[0..8]` in `[0, P)`, the exact decode formula is"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" ```text"},{"DocComment":" decode4(a,b,c,d) = (a + b*i) + (c + d*i)*u"},{"DocComment":" decode8(d) = decode4(d0,d1,d2,d3) + decode4(d4,d5,d6,d7)*v"},{"DocComment":" ```"},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Thus limb order is `(c0.c0.a, c0.c0.b, c0.c1.a, c0.c1.b,"},{"DocComment":" c1.c0.a, c1.c0.b, c1.c1.a, c1.c1.b)`, matching"},{"DocComment":" `R0C/ModuloField.lean:digitsField_apply` (lines 38–40) and"},{"DocComment":" `AspisV8R19/SamplerFieldDecode.lean:decode4` (line 10)."},{"DocComment":" `WideTower.lean:qm31_wideU_not_isSquare` supplies the mathematical"},{"DocComment":" non-residue fact; `wideExact_card` gives `|E| = P^8`."},{"DocComment":" These references specify the arithmetic; they do not prove this Rust code."},{"DocComment":""},{"DocComment":" Coordinates are private to preserve canonicality. Algebraic constructors"},{"DocComment":" reduce raw QM31 representatives; wire/digit decoders reject noncanonical"},{"DocComment":" input. All operations are total except inversion, which returns `None` at"},{"DocComment":" zero. This reference implementation makes no constant-time claim."}],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":true},"is_local":true,"opacity":"Transparent","lang_item":null},"generics":{"regions":[],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_clauses":[],"regions_outlive":[],"types_outlive":[],"trait_type_constraints":[]},"src":"TopLevel","kind":{"Struct":[{"span":{"data":{"file_id":7,"beg":{"line":29,"col":4},"end":{"line":29,"col":12}},"generated_from_span":null},"attr_info":{"attributes":[],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":false},"name":"c0","ty":{"Deduplicated":736}},{"span":{"data"